      "role": "user",
      "content": "but leaving isn't just about moving out or changing jobs... it's not that simple. the walls feel like they're closing in on me every single day. no matter what i do, i'm still stuck in this cycle. it feels like there's no actual way out of this cage without just... stopping everything. does that even make sense? it feels like the only way to truly be my own person is to just not be part of this anymore.",
